浜嗐�傚緢鍙�鑳戒細鏀瑰彉涓�鍦烘垬鏂楃殑灞�闈�锛岀敋鑷崇粨鏋溿�備絾鏄�锛岃�歌憶鏄庢湀浼氱偧閲戯紵浠栦滑鎬庝箞涓嶇煡閬撳晩锛�", "鈥滀綘瑕佷笉瑕侊紵鈥濊�歌憶鏄庢湀鍙堣拷闂�浜嗗彞銆�", "鈥滆�佸晩锛佹垜瑕侊紒鎴戣�佽�佽�侊紒鈥濊枦瀛愮殦灏卞樊璺宠捣鏉ヤ簡锛屸�滀綘瑕佹槸鐪熺殑鑳藉仛鍑烘潵锛屾垜褰撶劧瑕佸晩锛佲�濊枦瀛愮殦閭ｄ釜鍏村�嬪姴鍟婏紝鐪嬬殑涓囦繜杈颁竴鑴哥殑瀚屽純銆�", "锛嶏紞锛嶏紞锛嶏紞棰樺�栬瘽锛嶏紞锛嶏紞锛嶏紞", "瀵规�ょ珷鍚嶅瓧鎯虫��鐨勪汉锛岄潰澹佷笁鍒嗛挓鍘伙紒"], "_garbled": false, "novel_title": "腹黑狂女:倾城召唤师", "content_zh": "第4章 召唤的魔宠，到底何方神圣？一直没有任何动静的诸葛明月，在这一刻，身上忽然发出了阵阵白光！那是召唤出魔宠的前兆！仿佛与她身上的白光相呼应，遥远的天际也也忽的浮现出数道七色的彩虹，如同一座座传说中的虹桥，连接于天地之间。身上的白光一凝，明亮耀眼刺得人睁不开眼睛，化作一道有如实质的光柱，冲天而起，整个天空，都在这白光的映照下变得有如世界上最洁净最晶莹的白玉，不断释放着皎洁却又柔合的光芒。一副巨大的有如虚幻的景象浮现于半空之中，古树参天芳草萋萋，一条有如丝巾锦缎的溪流曲曲折折流向天边。波纹浮闪之间，那美景在一片光晕涟漪中摇曳生姿，仿佛来自梦中，令人发自内心的感到震撼。蓦的，光影猛的爆开，亦真亦幻的景色消失不见，无灵敏色彩绚丽的光点有如一阵拖着炙白焰尾的流星雨点般四处飞散，映花人眼。这一幕幕，太震撼了，让人不可置信，更让人完全移不开眼光。所有的人全部长大嘴巴，愣住了，都怔怔的看着眼前那华丽绚烂的光芒。如此震撼的气势，会是怎么样的魔宠？很多人在纷纷猜测着，看着诸葛明月的目光也变了。不明则已一鸣惊人就是说她么？凌飞扬此刻的脸色已经变成了菜色。骆惊风慢条斯理的说道：“校长啊，我是不是眼睛花了啊？那个毫无资质的诸葛明月，召唤出魔宠了啊。我肯定是眼神不太好啊。还有，高老师啊，咒语都念错的人，居然可以召唤魔宠，我是不是在做梦？”骆惊风慢吞吞的说着，语气很平静，但是说出来的话却让校长和高老师心惊肉跳，“要不，高老师，你掐我一下，看我是不是在做梦啊。”高老师的脸都白了，给他十个胆子他也不敢掐骆惊风啊！凌飞扬的脸色才是最难看的，他此刻再没有之前的风度翩翩，而是冷着眼瞪着满头冷汗的校长和高老师。骆惊风继续一脸平静的看着下面法阵中的动静。这个时候，七彩光芒已经在缓缓消失。诸葛明月召唤出来的魔宠很快就从那光芒中显现出身影来。那是什么？众人看着那团小小的身影，都愣住了。那是一只彩色鹦鹉？是鹦鹉吧？只不过，这鹦鹉，怎么好像似乎大概……有点肥？全场一片寂静，都愣愣的看着出现在半空的那只鹦鹉。那就是诸葛明月的魔宠？那么大动静召唤出来的居然是只肥鸟。那胖胖的鹦鹉扑棱着翅膀努力飞起来，却不料实在因为太重，一个踉跄，就往下掉。诸葛明月伸出手急忙接住了它。手上一沉，往下坠了坠。众人看着这一幕，终于忍不住哄堂大笑起来，笑的肆无忌惮，笑的前俯后仰。很多人心里更是幸灾乐祸，刚才那么大动静，惊天动地的，还真以为会是什么拉风的厉害魔宠，没想到是只连飞都困难的肥鸟！“笑个屁，你们这群俗人。”蓦然，一个巨大的嗓门骤然响起，刺痛了众人的耳膜。众人一愣，看向了诸葛明月手中的鹦鹉。是那只肥鸟在说话？！“小爷我英俊稳重，我的内涵岂是你们这群俗人能理解的？”不错，众人没有听错，没有看错。就是诸葛明月手中的那只肥胖鹦鹉在嚣张的说话，它转头看向诸葛明月，“就是你把小爷召唤出来的？你就是小爷的主人？还不错，长的漂亮，配的上小爷。”呱唧呱唧的说着，就扑棱着翅膀，飞到了诸葛明月的头上，稳稳的蹲了下来。诸葛明月此刻是满头黑线，她到底召唤出了个什么东西啊？“哼，不就是个肥鸟。刚才那么大动静，我们还以为是什么逆天的魔宠呢。”一个恼怒的声音传来。说话的这个女生，正是站在万俟辰旁边那个打扮可爱的女生。诸葛明月眼神一冷，转头看向那可爱女生，正要说话。头上的鹦鹉却抢先开口了：“该大的地方不大，该小的地方不小。你衣服反着穿别人也分不出来你前后。”够毒！够狠！够一针见血！那打扮可爱的女生，长相还行，穿着也是可爱风格，只是，胸部平平是她的致命弱点。这是她最在意的，现在大庭广众之下，被那只鹦鹉如此直接的说了出来！噗——诸葛明月忍不住没形象的笑了出来。而在场的众人在反应过来后，也都哄堂大笑起来。那打扮可爱的女生脸瞬间红的快滴出血来，怨毒的看了眼诸葛明月头上的鹦鹉，一跺脚，钻入人群中落荒而逃了。众人笑完以后，那鹦鹉啊啊叫了两声，那声音大的让人头疼。诸葛明月尤其被震的耳朵疼。然后它嚣张的大声叫嚷起来：“和小爷斗，打着灯笼上茅厕，找屎呢啊？还有谁，还有谁对小爷不满的？站出来，站出来！”“你太过分了，居然那样对一个可爱的女生。你这只肥鸟！”一个个子不高的男生站出来冲鹦鹉吼道，他刚才可没笑。然后他一出声，众人都认出来了，这个男生，不就是明恋那个可爱女生的么？不过，那女生对他可没意思。“你个矮子，你没女朋友吧？瞧你这身高，就算你找到了，要亲亲是不是也要找个凳子站在上面……呱呱啊啊……”话还没说完，它被诸葛明月一把从头上拽了下来，捂住了它的嘴。诸葛明月认为，发一个威就是震慑。如果发威过分，那就是拉仇恨了。她刚来这个世界，人生地不熟，还不想结那么多仇人。那矮个男生泪奔了，败走！这下没人敢嘲笑这只鹦鹉了，更不敢在大庭广众之下嘲笑了。这丫的说话太狠了，简直要命！广场一时间还真是万籁俱静。诸葛明月抱着肥鹦鹉，捂着它的嘴巴，走出了法阵，来到了法阵旁边负责登记的老师旁边，淡淡问道：“老师，如何？我过了么？”那负责登记的老师终于回过神，连连点头：“过了，过了。不过，你这个鹦鹉，算什么类别的呢？”“攻击类。”诸葛明月微微一笑，坦然回答。“哦哦，好。”那老师点头，提笔写了下来。召唤仪式，就此结束。接下来，会放假三天。这三天，是让学员们有充裕的时间去参加初级召唤师的考核。在学校里参加召唤仪式召唤出了魔宠，并非就成为了召唤师。还要经过召唤师协会的考核，才能成为初级召唤师。届时，召唤师协会会发布一个勋章，以及享有一些权利。在看台上，校长和几位老师的脸色也都不好看，尤其是信誓旦旦保证诸葛明月召唤不出魔宠的高老师，他此刻真想把头钻到桌子下面去再也不出来了。“凌少，啧啧，怎么办呢？我好像赢了啊。你是准备赖账呢还是……”骆惊风慢条斯理的说着，话还没说完。凌飞扬就拍案而起：“吵什么吵！愿赌服输。当她守护师就守护师，有什么了不起的。”说完，不等骆惊风说话，就快步离开看台，直接往广场而去。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/fuheikuangnu-qingchengzhaohuanshi/4.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 4 Who is the summoned demon pet? Zhuge Mingyue, who had been silent all this time, suddenly emitted bursts of white light at this moment! That's a sign of summoning a demon pet! As if echoing the white light on her body, several rainbows of seven colors suddenly appeared in the distant sky, like the legendary rainbow bridges, connecting the sky and the earth. The white light on his body condensed, so bright and dazzling that people could not open their eyes, and turned into a substantial light pillar, rising into the sky. Under the reflection of this white light, the entire sky became like the cleanest and most crystal clear white jade in the world, constantly releasing bright but soft light. A huge, illusory scene appeared in mid-air, with towering ancient trees and luxuriant grass, and a stream like a silk scarf flowing windingly toward the horizon. The beautiful scenery is swaying in the ripples of light, as if coming from a dream, which is shocking from the bottom of your heart. Suddenly, the light and shadow exploded violently, and the real and illusory scenery disappeared. The insensitive and colorful light spots flew around like a shower of meteors trailing with white flames, dazzling people's eyes. This scene was so shocking that it was unbelievable, and even more so that people couldn't take their eyes away. Everyone opened their mouths and were stunned, staring at the gorgeous light in front of them. What kind of demon pet would it be with such a shocking momentum? Many people were speculating, and their eyes when looking at Zhuge Mingyue also changed. If you don't know it, you've already become a blockbuster. Are you talking about her? Ling Feiyang's face turned pale at this moment. Luo Jingfeng said slowly: \"Principal, am I dazzled? That unqualified Zhuge Mingyue summoned a magic pet. I must have bad eyesight. Also, Teacher Gao, a person who pronounces the spell wrong can actually summon a magic pet. Am I doing this? Dream?\" Luo Jingfeng said slowly, his tone was very calm, but what he said made the principal and Teacher Gao tremble, \"Why don't you pinch me, Teacher Gao, to see if I'm dreaming?\" Teacher Gao's face turned pale, and he wouldn't dare to pinch Luo Jingfeng even if he had the guts to do so! Ling Feiyang's face was the most ugly. He no longer had the graceful demeanor before, but stared coldly at the principal and Teacher Gao who were covered in cold sweat. Luo Jingfeng continued to watch the movement in the magic circle below with a calm expression. At this time, the colorful light was slowly disappearing. The demon pet summoned by Zhuge Mingyue soon appeared from the light. What is that? Everyone was stunned when they looked at the small figure. Is that a colorful parrot? Is it a parrot? But why does this parrot seem to be...a little fat? The whole place was silent, and everyone stared at the parrot that appeared in mid-air. Is that Zhuge Mingyue's magic pet? What was summoned by such a big movement was actually a fat bird. The fat parrot flapped its wings and tried to fly, but unexpectedly it was too heavy and stumbled and fell down. Zhuge Mingyue stretched out his hand and quickly caught it. His hand felt heavy and fell downwards. Everyone looked at this scene and finally couldn't help but burst into laughter. They laughed unbridled and leaned forward and backward with laughter. Many people were even more gloating about their misfortune. There was such a big movement just now, so earth-shattering. They really thought it would be some powerful magic pet that could pull off the wind, but they didn't expect it to be a fat bird that could hardly even fly! \"You are laughing your ass off, you vulgar people.\" Suddenly, a huge voice suddenly sounded, hurting everyone's eardrums. Everyone was stunned and looked at the parrot in Zhuge Mingyue's hand. Is that the fat bird talking? ! \"Young master, I am handsome and steady, how can my connotation be understood by you common people?\" Yes, everyone heard and read correctly. It was the fat parrot in Zhuge Mingyue's hand that was speaking arrogantly. It turned to look at Zhuge Mingyue, \"You summoned me? Are you the master of me? Not bad, pretty and worthy of me.\" As he said this, he flapped his wings, flew to Zhuge Mingyue's head, and squatted down steadily. Zhuge Mingyue's head was covered with black lines at the moment. What on earth had she summoned? \"Huh, he's just a fat bird. With all the noise just now, we thought it was some kind of devilish pet.\" An angry voice came. The girl who spoke was the cute girl standing next to Wan Qichen. Zhuge Mingyue's eyes turned cold, and he turned to look at the cute girl, about to speak. But the parrot above his head spoke first: \"It's not big where it should be big, and it's not small where it should be small. If you wear your clothes backwards, others won't be able to tell the difference between your front and back.\" How vicious! Cruel enough! Quite to the point! The cute girl looks pretty good and dresses in a cute style, but her flat breasts are her Achilles' heel. This was what she cared about most, and now in public, the parrot said it so directly! Poof - Zhuge Mingyue couldn't help but laugh out loud. After everyone present reacted, they all burst into laughter. The cute girl's face instantly turned red to the point of bleeding. She glanced at the parrot on Zhuge Mingyue's head resentfully, stamped her feet, dove into the crowd and fled. After everyone finished laughing, the parrot chirped twice. The sound was so loud that it gave people a headache. Zhuge Mingyue was particularly shocked and his ears hurt. Then it yelled arrogantly: \"Fighting with me, going to the toilet with a lantern, looking for shit? Who else, who else is dissatisfied with me? Stand up, stand up!\" \"You've gone too far. You did that to a cute girl. You fat bird!\" A short boy stood up and yelled at the parrot. He didn't smile just now. Then as soon as he spoke out, everyone recognized him. Isn't this boy the one who is in love with that cute girl? However, that girl was not interested in him. \"You dwarf, you don't have a girlfriend, do you? Look at your height, even if you find one, you want to kiss her", "title_en": "Chapter 4"}